# JS Web Interface

See `docs/agents/web-integration.md` for full conventions.

- Vanilla JS only — no Vue imports or shared app code
- Self-contained `BookingManager` class for external website embedding
- Built with uglifyjs to `dist/cdn/current/booking-manager.min.js`
- Breaking API or placeholder changes need changelog entry and README update
